@host = http://localhost:5080
@aliceIncidentId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@bobIncidentId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@aliceNewIncidentId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@bobCommentId = 30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@internalCommentId = 30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003

### 1. Login as Alice (Reporter)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "alice",
  "password": "{{$processEnv SeedUsers__Password}}"
}

### 2. A-02: Alice reads own incident (Expected: 200 OK)
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceIncidentId}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. A-03 (PoC IDOR/BOLA): Alice reads Bob's incident (Vulnerable: 200 OK, Fixed: 404 Not Found)
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobIncidentId}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. A-04: Alice tries to update Bob's incident (Fixed: 404 Not Found)
PUT {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobIncidentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hacked by Alice",
  "description": "Attempt to modify foreign incident description.",
  "severity": "Low"
}

### 5. A-06 & A-09: Alice (Reporter) tries privileged triage (Fixed: 403 Forbidden + audit log)
POST {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceNewIncidentId}}/triage

### 6. A-12: Alice tries to read Bob's comment directly (Fixed: 404 Not Found)
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/{{bobCommentId}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Login as Morgan (Analyst)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "morgan",
  "password": "{{$processEnv SeedUsers__Password}}"
}

### 8. A-03R: Morgan (Analyst) reads Alice's incident for analysis (Expected: 200 OK)
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceIncidentId}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. A-07: Morgan (Analyst) performs allowed triage New -> Triaged (Expected: 204 NoContent)
POST {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceNewIncidentId}}/triage
